{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本將於11月1日起向旅客實施「先付後退」退稅新制，由以往購物時可同時在店舖退稅，改為購物時先付包括10%消費稅的金額（部分食品與飲料適用8%輕減稅率），離境時在機場辦理退稅。</p><p>本文綜合退稅新制的流程及相關資訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:01:37.210803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:19.300520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:58:26.085620+00:00","content_hash":"579501fd920fc223a027586dd8c671ddfd79c819131e066ef2c8ec3044e29e3c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}